From: Dynamic Devices <info@dynamicdevices.co.uk>
Subject: [PATCH] cmake: make the guest rootfs downloader optional

Embedded evaluation images provision guest userspace separately. Do not ship
a downloader or pull in dependencies for a tool these images do not use.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [embedded evaluation configuration]

--- a/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -8,5 +8,6 @@
 option(BUILD_THUNKS "Build thunks" FALSE)
 option(BUILD_FEXCONFIG "Build FEXConfig" TRUE)
+option(BUILD_ROOTFS_FETCHER "Build FEXRootFSFetcher" TRUE)
 option(ENABLE_CLANG_THUNKS "Build thunks with clang" TRUE)
 option(ENABLE_IWYU "Enable the Include What You Use sanitizer" FALSE)
 option(ENABLE_LTO "Enable LTO with compilation" TRUE)
--- a/Source/Tools/CMakeLists.txt
+++ b/Source/Tools/CMakeLists.txt
@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ if (NOT MINGW)
     add_subdirectory(FEXGDBReader/)
   endif()
 
-  if (NOT BUILD_STEAM_SUPPORT)
+  if (BUILD_ROOTFS_FETCHER AND NOT BUILD_STEAM_SUPPORT)
     add_subdirectory(FEXRootFSFetcher/)
   endif()
 
